---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../../../components/Hero.astro";
import Figure from "../../../components/Figure.astro";
import Icon from "../../../components/Icon.astro";
import AdSlot from "../../../components/AdSlot.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../consts";
import heroImg from "../../../assets/photos/kyoto-apit-auto-interieur.jpg";
import volantsImg from "../../../assets/photos/kyoto-apit-auto-mur-volants.jpg";
import miniaturesImg from "../../../assets/photos/kyoto-apit-auto-miniatures-livres.jpg";
import evoImg from "../../../assets/photos/kyoto-apit-auto-miniature-evo9.jpg";

const shopName = "A PIT AUTOBACS KYOTO SHIJO";
const shopAddress = "1 Saiin Yasuzukacho, Ukyo Ward, Kyoto 615-0051, Japan";
const mapsHref = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(`${shopName}, ${shopAddress}`)}`;
const websiteHref = "https://www.apit-autobacs.com/kyoto/";

const sections = [
  "Scale models of every size",
  "T-shirts and clothing",
  "Goodies",
  "Magazines",
  "Cars",
  "Kits to modify your own car",
];
---

<Layout
  title="A-PIT Auto Kyoto"
  description="A-PIT Auto in Kyoto: a whole floor dedicated to cars, with scale models, clothing, magazines and tuning kits. Practical info, prices and my review."
>
  <Hero
    image={heroImg}
    eyebrow="Great spot · Kyoto"
    title="A-PIT Auto Kyoto"
    subtitle="Several floors, a whole one for car enthusiasts, and the scale model I'd been hunting for since Tokyo."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-16 pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <a
      href={withBase("/en/kyoto/")}
      class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft"
    >
      <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      Back to Kyoto
    </a>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      While I was in Tokyo, I had never heard of this store. On my last day, before flying back to France, I looked
      for cool places to visit, and A-PIT Auto is the one that really made me want to go. I'll tell you all about it in
      this article.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-10 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">Practical info</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{shopName}</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
          {shopAddress}
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="clock" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
          10 a.m. to 8 p.m.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="train" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
          10 min walk from Yamanouchi Station (Randen) or 14 min from Saiin Station (Hankyu)
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="parking" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
          On-site parking: first hour free, 2 hours free with a purchase of ¥1,000 or more
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
        <a
          href={mapsHref}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
        >
          Open in Google Maps
          <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </a>
        <a
          href={websiteHref}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
        >
          Official website (in Japanese)
          <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">A whole floor for enthusiasts</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      The store spreads over several floors, and one of them is entirely dedicated to cars. Here's what you'll find
      there:
    </p>
    <ul class="reveal mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {sections.map((section) => (
        <li class="rounded-full border border-mist-200 bg-paper px-3.5 py-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink">{section}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <Figure
        image={volantsImg}
        alt="Wall of NARDI, OMP and Prodrive steering wheels at A-PIT Auto Kyoto"
        caption="The steering wheel wall: NARDI, OMP, Prodrive…"
        aspectClass="aspect-[4/3]"
      />
      <Figure
        image={miniaturesImg}
        alt="Shelves of scale models, Fast & Furious collections and car magazines at A-PIT Auto Kyoto"
        caption="Scale models and magazines, including a Fast & Furious collection."
        aspectClass="aspect-[4/3]"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <AdSlot class="py-8" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-16 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">My take</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      All in all, it's a great store. Prices are affordable for clothing, goodies and magazines. Scale models are
      pricier, but connoisseurs will find some real gems and rare pieces.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/50 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-14">
        <div>
          <p class="reveal eyebrow text-racing-500">A little story</p>
          <h2 class="reveal mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-3xl">My gem before flying home</h2>
          <div class="reveal mt-5 space-y-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            <p>
              I really wanted to bring home a scale model of the Mitsubishi I had <a
                href={withBase("/en/tokyo/only-jdm/")}
                class="link-underline font-medium text-racing-500">rented in Tokyo</a>, but despite searching the
              different stores, I had never found it.
            </p>
            <p>
              It was here, in an aisle entirely dedicated to the brand, that I finally found my gem: the scale model
              closest to my rental, a Lancer Evolution IX, in the same silver as my Evo VIII.
            </p>
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">A really nice souvenir before heading back to France.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <Figure
          image={evoImg}
          alt="Scale model of a silver Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution IX on its black display base"
          caption="My Lancer Evolution IX, brought back from A-PIT Auto."
        />
      </div>

      <div class="reveal mt-12 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper p-5">
        <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">Good to know</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          You can even buy miniature garages to display your cars, but they cost a fair bit, and they take up room in
          your suitcase!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
      <a
        href={withBase("/en/kyoto/")}
        class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        Back to all Kyoto spots
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
